WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.687
Section 4: File a parliamentary e-petition on ourcommons.ca.

00:00:05.637 --> 00:00:13.650
If it reaches 500 signatures, the government is legally required to table a response within 45 calendar days.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:18.137
This is one of the most underused tools in Canadian democracy.

00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:23.512
You need a sponsoring MP to table the petition — contact your MP first.
